<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 01:34:07 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>一个 LED 在室温下产生四种稳定的颜色</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/one-led-produces-four-stable-colors-at-room-temperature</link><description>全彩显示器通常需要单独的红、绿和蓝光发射器。大阪大学和立命馆大学的一个团队展示了另一种方法：单个发光层在室温下通电时会产生多种颜色。该研究是&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/one-led-produces-four-stable-colors-at-room-temperature.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 01:34:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/one-led-produces-four-stable-colors-at-room-temperature</guid></item><item><title>爱因斯坦问题的新转折揭示了意想不到的物理现象</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/new-twist-on-the-einstein-problem-reveals-unexpected-physics</link><description>一种因解决数十年之久的数学难题而引起全世界关注的形状又重新成为人们关注的焦点。虽然该形状的特性使其能够解决之前的难题，但人们对它的其他相关特性知之甚少，这为进一步发现创造了机会。这些未经探索的特性也可能有助于解决新的物理谜团，例如如何将光扭曲成引人注目的手性图案。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/new-twist-on-the-einstein-problem-reveals-unexpected-physics.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 01:19:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/new-twist-on-the-einstein-problem-reveals-unexpected-physics</guid></item><item><title>手掌中的量子：超导量子位的演变</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/quantum-in-the-palm-of-your-hand-the-evolution-of-superconducting-qubits</link><description>电子穿过晶体管，为我们智能手机的屏幕供电。光从遥远的恒星射向地球，其移动速度比宇宙中任何其他物体都快。质子使 MRI 机器能够分析人们的受伤情况。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/quantum-in-the-palm-of-your-hand-the-evolution-of-superconducting-qubits.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 01:04:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/quantum-in-the-palm-of-your-hand-the-evolution-of-superconducting-qubits</guid></item><item><title>一个简单的扭转就可以解锁新一代电子产品</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/a-simple-twist-could-unlock-a-new-generation-of-electronics</link><description>科学家现在可以将大型氧化物晶体扭曲成具有潜在强大电子特性的新材料。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-simple-twist-could-unlock-a-new-generation-of-electronics2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:49:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/a-simple-twist-could-unlock-a-new-generation-of-electronics</guid></item><item><title>解开生命密码：科学家查明DNA首先打开的位置</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/unzipping-the-code-of-life-scientists-pinpoint-where-dna-first-opens</link><description>研究人员绘制了 DNA 首先打开的位置以及当基因组复制开始时解旋酶门如何释放一条链的图谱。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/unzipping-the-code-of-life-scientists-pinpoint-where-dna-first-opens2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:34:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/unzipping-the-code-of-life-scientists-pinpoint-where-dna-first-opens</guid></item><item><title>孤独会让人生病——但仅靠药物无法治愈它</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/loneliness-is-making-people-sick-but-medicine-cant-fix-it-alone</link><description>将孤独视为健康问题可能会鼓励人们采取行动，但会掩盖其背后更广泛的社会条件。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/loneliness-is-making-people-sick-but-medicine-cant-fix-it-alone2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:19:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/loneliness-is-making-people-sick-but-medicine-cant-fix-it-alone</guid></item><item><title>地球对极端太阳风暴的脆弱性可能是科学家认为的两倍</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/earth-may-be-twice-as-vulnerable-to-extreme-solar-storms-as-scientists-thought</link><description>地球可能比科学家意识到的更容易受到强大太阳风暴的影响，极端事件对现代技术的打击可能是之前模型预测的两倍。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/eart